This Privacy Policy describes how the Spy Hunters mobile application ("App", "we", "our") handles your information. We are committed to protecting your privacy.

Information We Collect
Information We Do NOT Collect
We do not collect, store, or transmit any personal information. Specifically, we do not collect:

Names, email addresses, or contact information
Location data
Photos, media, or files
Device identifiers for advertising purposes
Browsing or search history
Analytics or usage tracking data
Locally Stored Data
The App stores the following data exclusively on your device using local storage. This data never leaves your device and is not accessible to us:

Game settings (player count, timer duration, game mode)
Player names entered during gameplay
Language preferences
Custom word and location packs you create
This data is stored locally and can be deleted at any time by uninstalling the App.

Subscriptions
The App offers optional auto-renewable subscription plans (Weekly and Yearly) that unlock premium content packs and features.

Subscription Details
Payment is charged to your Apple ID account at confirmation of purchase
Subscriptions automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current billing period
Your account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period
You can manage and cancel your subscriptions by going to your App Store account settings after purchase
Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when you purchase a subscription
RevenueCat
We use RevenueCat, a third-party service, to manage subscriptions. RevenueCat processes the following data on our behalf:

An anonymous, randomly generated user identifier (not linked to your personal identity)
Subscription status and purchase history (provided by Apple)
Device locale/language setting
RevenueCat does not receive your name, email, or any other personal information from our App. RevenueCat's privacy policy is available at: https://www.revenuecat.com/privacy/

Third-Party Services
The App does not integrate any advertising networks, analytics platforms, or social media SDKs. The only third-party service used is RevenueCat for subscription management as described above.

Children's Privacy
The App does not knowingly collect any personal information from children. Since we do not collect personal data from any users, the App is safe for use by children under the supervision of a parent or guardian.

Data Security
Since all user data is stored locally on your device and we do not collect or transmit personal information, there is no risk of data breaches from our servers.

Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy periodically.

